      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doncaster%2C_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Perched atop a 120‑metre hill, Doncaster’s core hosts historic buildings, a shopping centre, and high‑rise apartments overlooking the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doncaster%2C_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The nearest train link is Box Hill station, just 3 km south, connecting residents to Melbourne’s CBD.",
